{"unit_id":"Choco-Zz__dsh-image-amnesia#card-zh","repo":"Choco-Zz/dsh-image-amnesia","commit":"bfae86309aa7ac844e3726985165dfa7942d44a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-amnesia 是一个适用于 DSH 各 agent 的图片上下文插件。它在 LLM 适配器发出请求前包装调用，只投影请求中的消息，不修改本机会话记录。插件会从较早的图片开始移除内容，直到符合图片数量或总字节预算，同时保留至少指定数量的最新图片，并用提示文本替代被移除项。用户可调整启用状态、图片数量、字节上限和保留数量。适合图片较多、需要控制模型请求体大小的 DSH 会话；无需插件专属密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:21-42","src/policy.js:11-16","src/policy.js:118-138"]}
{"unit_id":"Choco-Zz__dsh-image-amnesia#card-en","repo":"Choco-Zz/dsh-image-amnesia","commit":"bfae86309aa7ac844e3726985165dfa7942d44a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-amnesia limits historical images in DSH model requests. It removes older images to meet count and byte budgets while retaining a minimum number of newest images. Local session history remains unchanged. For image-heavy DSH sessions; no plugin-specific key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:21-42","src/policy.js:11-16","src/policy.js:118-138"]}
