{"unit_id":"Choco-Zz__dsh-image-amnesia#feature-budget","repo":"Choco-Zz/dsh-image-amnesia","commit":"bfae86309aa7ac844e3726985165dfa7942d44a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-amnesia 的功能「图片请求预算」：在 LLM adapter 发出请求前统计图片数量和字节数，从最早的图片开始移除，直到满足数量或体积上限，并至少保留配置数量的最新图片；移除项以提示文本替代。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/wrap-adapter.js:42-50","src/policy.js:69-80","src/policy.js:118-138"]}
{"unit_id":"Choco-Zz__dsh-image-amnesia#feature-settings","repo":"Choco-Zz/dsh-image-amnesia","commit":"bfae86309aa7ac844e3726985165dfa7942d44a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-amnesia 的功能「策略设置」：通过 image-amnesia 设置区配置启用状态、最多保留图片数、最大字节数和至少保留的最新图片数；设置变化会刷新运行中的策略。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:62-73","src/policy.js:11-27"]}
{"unit_id":"Choco-Zz__dsh-image-amnesia#caveat-request","repo":"Choco-Zz/dsh-image-amnesia","commit":"bfae86309aa7ac844e3726985165dfa7942d44a8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-amnesia 使用前须知：它会删减准备发往 LLM 适配器的请求图片；被移除图片仍保存在本机会话中，插件未配置专属服务或密钥。（见 src/wrap-adapter.js:42-50）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/wrap-adapter.js:42-50","src/policy.js:5-9"]}
